# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the page itself
# A page fetches by URL relative to the DOCUMENT (site/), so the scripts' fetches of
# carts and disks gain their folder. A bare name in ?demo= / ?disk= / ?c= (every link
# made before site/ had folders, the SDK's `make run`, the tutorial's Run button) still
# works: siteUrl() puts it in its folder.
